<title>USA: Rancho Cucamonga Redevelopment 5.90 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Rancho Cucamonga Redevelopment 5.90 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EJ De La Rosa &amp; Co said it priced $37.7 million Rancho Cucamonga Redevelopment Agency Ranch Rdevelopment Project 1996 housing set-aside tax allocation bonds, with a top yield of 5.90 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are dated 9/1/1996.</p>
<p>The first coupon is 3/1/1997.</p>
<p>The bonds are due 9/1.</p>
<p>The delivery is expected 9/10/1996.</p>
<p>The bonds are rated MBIA-insured and rated Aaa by Moody's Investors Service and AAA Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.  </p>
